{"clock":2,"ops":[{"kind":"link","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","forge_id":"5958447467","number":"30","url":"https://github.com/guilbep/git-board/issues/30"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","field":"title","value":"bridge: keep a bridge's label namespaces off the forge"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","field":"body","value":"Prerequisite for ADR 0001 item 1. Today the git-bug fork sends every label it doesn't translate to the forge as a label: `status:`, `prio:`, `est:`, `sprint:` and `mod:` reach GitHub as labels, even when git-board writes them to the Project. The fork has no way to keep a label namespace off a forge.\n\n## What to build (fork, `bridge-sync`)\n- A per-bridge key listing namespaces kept off the forge, for example `git config git-bug.bridge.\u003cname\u003e.held status,prio,est,sprint,mod`. git-board writes it into each clone, as it writes `assignees`, `kinds` and `sprints`, and only with `[github-project]` `write = true`.\n- A held namespace is outside the forge's label set on both sides:\n  - it is never sent;\n  - its absence on the forge is never read as a removal;\n  - the label set recorded as last seen leaves it out.\n  The fork already does this for assignees (`labeled` in `bridge/core/syncassignees.go`).\n- Clean-up: a held label already on a forge issue comes off at the next sync, and the dry run lists it.\n- Issues not on the Project: hold nothing back for them, or git-board adds them to the Project first (ADR item 1).\n\n## Notes\n- native-fields left `sprint:` labels going to GitHub on purpose, because co2's Project writes are off. This key is how git-board would hold them back once it writes the Project.\n- Live tests on scratch forges only (guilbep/git-bug-sync-test, guilbep/git-board-test with Project 1).\n"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","field":"status","value":"open"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","field":"labels","value":"kind:feat\nprio:p2\nstatus:backlog"}},{"kind":"seen","author":"ee004d31386b76440a74651c79871f156633d4ff","time":1793004401,"data":{"issue":"4bb6b9fc250cf691016ef8b75cab2e1d23799f7d","field":"assignees","value":"161889"}}]}